{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The SNAPTOGGLE anchors fit my recent interest in drywall anchors and screws because they offer another way to secure something to a wall.",
    "A heavier-duty mounting option feels relevant, provided its wall requirements and load capacity suit my project."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Tape, hinge shims, caulk, and pegboard locks address specific jobs I have not shown a need for; sharing a connection to hardware does not make them useful to me now.",
    "Buying bags for a Panasonic vacuum does not mean I need a separate wet/dry vacuum, and measuring medicine in graduated cups does not imply an interest in drink pouches.",
    "The toilet plunger and antifreeze tester do not connect to any current maintenance task in my recent activity."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interest in fastening supplies seems to have been stretched into an interest in almost any home repair supply.",
    "Loose associations with vacuum cleaning and plastic containers seem to have outweighed the particular purpose of the items I explored."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My repeated attention to nails, screws, and drywall anchors suggests that fastening and mounting are stronger current interests than unrelated repair tasks.",
    "Fit and specifications matter: my nail choices include particular sizes and collation types, and my vacuum bags specify compatible Panasonic models.",
    "I need a clear use for an item before choosing it; a possible connection to construction or household upkeep is not enough."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly recognized my mounting interests but broadened them into unrelated household maintenance needs."
}"}
